 "about": "Shared by same-work.js (the app) and contribution_same_work.py (the platform): two GitHub comparisons of a PR's version against the base's tip, and whether the PR's own change is the same. A file with no patch is compared by its content id (sha), a file with a patch by its added and removed lines. The 300-file limit is tested separately in each language.",
